{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>22歲美國網紅Sydney Thomas兩年前擔任美國前拳王泰臣（Mike Tyson）對戰美國網紅Jake Paul拳賽的擂台女郎而走紅，於社交網站累積93萬追隨者。她保持傳統金髮尤物形象，笑容甜美，還不時戴上美國風格的牛仔帽拍照，留言表示：「等我戴住牛仔帽同着住比堅尼咁樣埋葬我。」</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:50:27.958481+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T14:01:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:35:39.345884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T14:43:43.264345+00:00","content_hash":"e164e0313d418efbf50cb9b7a427080ed6ad272a56d3d64786f3e2a21bf962b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:50:27.958481+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}